Package: SAShiny
Title: Use Unchanged 'SAS' Programs as the Server of 'Shiny' Applications
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mehar Pratap", "Singh", , "meharpsingh@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("Shreya", "Sharma", role = "ctb"),
    person("Love", "ProCogia", role = "ctb"),
    person("ProCogia", role = "fnd")
  )
Description: Pairs an unmodified 'SAS' program with a declarative 'YAML'
    sidecar contract so that 'SAS' performs the analysis while 'Shiny'
    renders the user interface. The contract declares typed inputs, which
    are validated and safely passed to 'SAS' as macro variables, and outputs
    such as datasets, 'ODS' graphics, listings, logs and downloads.
    Connections to 'SAS' 9.4 and 'SAS Viya' are made through 'SASPy'.
    'SAS' is a registered trademark of SAS Institute Inc. and 'Shiny' is a
    registered trademark of Posit Software, PBC; this package is not
    affiliated with or endorsed by either company.
